  "title": "Mawson Infrastructure Group Inc. to Ring the Closing Bell at NASDAQ",
  "summary": "MIDLAND, PA., Nov. 21, 2024 — Mawson Infrastructure Group Inc. (NASDAQ: MIGI) (“Mawson” or “the Company”), a publicly-traded technology company focused on digital infrastructure platforms for artificial intelligence (AI), high-performance computing (HPC), and digital assets markets, today announced that it will be ringing the Closing Bell at NASDAQ on Thursday, November 21, 2024.",
